{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1428992,\"title\":\"Fox Demon Legend\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"What seems like a demon is in fact something called desire that is stirring up trouble in people's hearts. This story tells us that the only way to stay righteous amid the corruption and live a good life is to revere life and respect nature. Let us follow in the footsteps of “Jiuye” Song Tailai and experience the ups and downs in this decades-long story brimming with love and hate...\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xSSu3AnTIeI516AdLa9tBc9Y4cz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4zCwHl7Ot6cxsiTaSr8vxMo0e6z.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":77,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Yu Ge\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3248329,\"name\":\"Yu Ge\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d1EeeOzI9X98hirLcoLrJehT51m.jpg\"},{\"id\":1127730,\"name\":\"Wang Kuirong\",\"character\":\"Song Tailai\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jvJ1yAmLG8bdcqgq87ci5fQLfHK.jpg\"},{\"id\":2225237,\"name\":\"Lin Fengye\",\"character\":\"Li Changxiao\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6O2x3D0vANE7JUJ5dyM1rHQJdva.jpg\"},{\"id\":3873511,\"name\":\"Yang Luoqian\",\"character\":\"Luoshui\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hDzIXAm6Pz8DQFXLkmXkjcpDcwg.jpg\"},{\"id\":1793618,\"name\":\"Yan Jiaying\",\"character\":\"Purple Cabbage\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9HBiR1IPXnxdHE1AyKc9nbRSTON.jpg\"},{\"id\":2511432,\"name\":\"Yue Dongfeng\",\"character\":\"Zhao Fugui\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2oDLiuoxuJpuitHDq7BTj7mtDxd.jpg\"},{\"id\":2253629,\"name\":\"Chai Yuanle\",\"character\":\"Li Jinshan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xhPavtzeziBrR0rx5hqoJxEzbWB.jpg\"},{\"id\":2853950,\"name\":\"Chen Zhengyang\",\"character\":\"Zhao Shanyu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vimCtZUKWhQgPcOX6mBAYjNs6lK.jpg\"},{\"id\":3277566,\"name\":\"Li Dachuan\",\"character\":\"Night Watchman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3023800,\"name\":\"Li Baomin\",\"character\":\"Li Xiangqian\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":419430,\"title\":\"Get Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tFXcEccSQMf3lfhfXKSU9iRBpa3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bBQHALHRAaaORlPNXv7fNcRXYdx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chris and his girlfriend Rose go upstate to visit her parents for the weekend. At first, Chris reads the family's overly accommodating behavior as nervous attempts to deal with their daughter's interracial relationship, but as the weekend progresses, a series of increasingly disturbing discoveries lead him to a truth that he never could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1290418,\"title\":\"The Cycle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5gSNf55KWfDc9hqP4H1KCCSutE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bgHW6AJl2SdKzxglvf9tshXbI84.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A daughter unravels her father's dark past after his body, missing for 36 years, is found at a horrific crime scene.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":493922,\"title\":\"Hereditary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GFPuL14eXi66V96xBWY73Y9PfR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pS9Aub8MPyQbENblGD8mHeaqMuv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the matriarch of the Graham family passes away, her daughter begins to unravel cryptic and increasingly terrifying secrets about her ancestry.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":423108,\"title\":\"The Conjuring: The Devil Made Me Do It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xbSuFiJbbBWCkyCCKIMfuDCA4yV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p26c040MErns7DJYhisa1CpVB5i.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren encounter what would become one of the most sensational cases from their files. The fight for the soul of a young boy takes them beyond anything they'd ever seen before, to mark the first time in U.S. history that a murder suspect would claim demonic possession as a defense.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":82507,\"title\":\"Sinister\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nzx10sca3arCeYBAomHan4Q6wa1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jovIEk4cAxWmA2dBcPrfhn3jzYN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"True-crime writer Ellison Oswalt is in a slump; he hasn't had a best seller in more than 10 years and is becoming increasingly desperate for a hit. So, when he discovers the existence of a snuff film showing the deaths of a family, he vows to solve the mystery. He moves his own family into the victims' home and gets to work. However, when old film footage and other clues hint at the presence of a supernatural force, Ellison learns that living in the house may be fatal.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1933,\"title\":\"The Others\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8g1vlTvpM6nr2hMMiZ1fUlKF0D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/FY0NvzWMeCZeF3xdHIu0GtFHj7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Grace is a religious woman who lives in an old house kept dark because her two children, Anne and Nicholas, have a rare sensitivity to light. When the family begins to suspect the house is haunted, Grace fights to protect her children at any cost in the face of strange events and disturbing visions.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":838209,\"title\":\"Exhuma\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQYHouPsDw32FhDLr7E3jmw0WTk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kYWk8TW5TkpCWkB0mkUm72N0lb8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After tracing the origin of a disturbing supernatural affliction to a wealthy family's ancestral gravesite, a team of paranormal experts relocates the remains—and soon discovers what happens to those who dare to mess with the wrong grave.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":913290,\"title\":\"Barbarian\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/idT5mnqPcJgSkvpDX7pJffBzdVH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kSeU4uk19t82k6Cao7hc6ktDYhF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In town for a job interview, a young woman arrives at her Airbnb late at night only to find that it has been mistakenly double-booked and a strange man is already staying there. Against her better judgement, she decides to stay the night anyway.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":207933,\"title\":\"Stonehearst Asylum\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fZxGCCQ0NAtraevqULJ84wSSjo0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/988AG01BZZe62P33jemkFIacxF9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An Oxford Medical School graduate takes a position at a mental institution and soon becomes obsessed with a female mental patient, but he has no idea of a recent and horrifying staffing change.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1023922,\"title\":\"MaXXXine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ArvoFK6nlouZRxYmtIOUzKIrg90.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/viKEEaaCaZ0hZ2nGuvIEozlLooL.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1980s Hollywood, adult film star and aspiring actress Maxine Minx finally gets her big break. But as a mysterious killer stalks the starlets of Hollywood, a trail of blood threatens to reveal her sinister past.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":631843,\"title\":\"Old\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vclShucpUmPhdAOmKgf3B3Z4POD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32yqxyLlWcO81UCx51Jfq9aeJdA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of families on a tropical holiday discover that the secluded beach where they are staying is somehow causing them to age rapidly – reducing their entire lives into a single day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":619730,\"title\":\"Don't Worry Darling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wjAJWfuE5OQm5zerlOAbTxdHFMV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tfCNMP37jRX3TOetuce7FLkxNKa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Alice and Jack are lucky to be living in the idealized community of Victory, the experimental company town housing the men who work for the top-secret Victory Project and their families. But when cracks in their idyllic life begin to appear, exposing flashes of something much more sinister lurking beneath the attractive façade, Alice can’t help questioning exactly what they’re doing in Victory, and why.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"kqK-vx4v_YA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"CcQ_NCDumxU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"_XEZHlWlZ_o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}